# direnv: auto-enter the pinned toolchain. The flake sits at the repo
# ROOT -- this is a standalone crate headed for opensource, so it carries
# an ordinary root `flake.nix` like any Rust project. Root also means the
# flake can SEE `Cargo.toml`/`src/`, which a flake in a subdirectory
# cannot. The gate itself is `hk.pkl`, run by hk (V64).
use flake
